Short Term:
- Name!
- Do we want it to be aware of SDM? (against NGSI-LD, but can be an "extra")
- RAM-DB:
  - Tenants
  - Geo-query filtering — ramdbEntityQuery handles id, idPattern, type, scopeQ, and q filters, but the geoRel/geometry/coordinates/geoproperty fields in DbQueryFilter
    are completely ignored. The query_entities_geo.test and tenant_geo.test exist but likely rely on the mongoc plugin.
  - Entity delete — no ramdbEntityDelete function. The DbDriver interface doesn't even have an entityDelete slot yet.
  - Entity update/patch/replace — no merge-patch, append, or replace operations.
  - Attribute-level ops — no partial attribute update or delete.
  - Value list matching is incomplete — in matchTerm, the LdQValueList case for numeric lists has a comment "list values stored as strings for now -- skip complex list handling".


